; Fixture: failure-mode REQ-TEST-043 (Memorization-vs-Induction).
;
; A candidate that fits the training corpus (all 10 documents in the
; 5-fold split satisfy `(:r0 ?d) >= 0`) but fails on the held-out
; document set in `holdout_folds/fold_4.jsonl`, where one document
; has `:r0 = -1`. The orchestrator must run the candidate across all
; 5 folds, observe fold_4's sat-rate drop below 0.5, and reject with
; reason `:memorization`.
(defconstraint :induced/memorized
  :scope :subject
  :backend :z3
  :assert (>= (:r0 ?d) 0)
  :on-unsat {:defect :D-induced-memorized
             :severity :low})
